{
  "file_id": "3613",
  "text_count": 98,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Where did Yamato go...?",
      "_offset": 1501,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Don't worry, Takeru. Yamato isn't\nthe type to leave his friends\nbehind.",
      "_offset": 1533,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "There's probably stuff he needs to\ndo by himself, but I'm sure he'll\ncome back.",
      "_offset": 1605,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 1685,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "(Right, Yamato...?)",
      "_offset": 1693,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Taichi, I also believe that we\nshould trust in Yamato, but...",
      "_offset": 1713,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Yamato may have gotten into some\nkind of trouble, so shouldn't we\nsearch around here?",
      "_offset": 1775,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I agree. This is Pinocchimon's\nterritory, so we should join up as\nsoon as we can.",
      "_offset": 1861,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "All right, guys! Let's get going!\nWe're looking for Yamato!",
      "_offset": 1943,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Look, Taichi! It's a Koromon.",
      "_offset": 2003,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "It looks hurt...",
      "_offset": 2033,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hey! Koromon, what happened to\nyou?!",
      "_offset": 2050,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "T-the Dark Masters... attacked...\nthe village...",
      "_offset": 2087,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "So the Dark Masters have hurt even\nmore Digimon...",
      "_offset": 2136,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "When it ran away from the village,\nit must have gotten separated from\nits friends...",
      "_offset": 2187,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "We can't just leave it alone! Not\nwhen it's injured like this!",
      "_offset": 2272,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Let's find the other Koromon and\nbring them together!",
      "_offset": 2335,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Takeru...",
      "_offset": 2389,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yeah, I know.",
      "_offset": 2399,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "We'll find Yamato for sure. But\nright now, we have to help the\nKoromon!",
      "_offset": 2413,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Here... everyone...",
      "_offset": 2485,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Anyone...? There's an injured\nKoromon. Is anyone here...?",
      "_offset": 2505,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Thank you for helping our friend!",
      "_offset": 2566,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "What on earth happened?",
      "_offset": 2600,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Pinocchimon attacked our village,\nand we all ran, but...",
      "_offset": 2624,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "We can't live in our village\nanymore. It was destroyed.",
      "_offset": 2681,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "...Unforgivable.",
      "_offset": 2737,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "How's that injured one doing?",
      "_offset": 2754,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "The wounds are deep... we need\nmedicinal herbs, but we don't have\nany anymore.",
      "_offset": 2784,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 100,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I'll go look for some. Stay here\nand wait for me, guys.",
      "_offset": 2863,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 101,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "I'm going with you!",
      "_offset": 2919,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 97,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Me, too!",
      "_offset": 2939,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 112,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "All right, then let's hurry!",
      "_offset": 2948,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "The herb should be a red flower\nthat's bigger than us. It should\nbe near here.",
      "_offset": 2977,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 101,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "It's hard to find, so keep that in\nmind.",
      "_offset": 3056,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 46,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Ah! Taichi, look!",
      "_offset": 3097,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 119,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Isn't that what the Koromon was\ntalking about? A red flower bigger\nthan a Koromon?",
      "_offset": 3115,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 46,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "You're right! It was pretty far\naway, though. Good job finding it,\nHikari.",
      "_offset": 3198,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 109,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "You have good eyes.",
      "_offset": 3273,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Eheheh...",
      "_offset": 3293,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It's 'cause you're always watching\nTV with Dad...",
      "_offset": 3303,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 44,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "T-that's not it!",
      "_offset": 3353,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 115,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Obtained herb!",
      "_offset": 3370,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Obtained herb!",
      "_offset": 3385,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 109,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Obtained herb!",
      "_offset": 3400,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Thank you! We can help all our\ninjured ones with this!",
      "_offset": 3415,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Has Yamato still not returned?",
      "_offset": 3470,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 68,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "...Nope.",
      "_offset": 3501,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 118,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "_offset": 3510,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 97,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "What should we do, Taichi? Should\nwe wait here for Yamato?",
      "_offset": 3517,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 101,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Or should we find a place where we\ncan stave off the Dark Masters?",
      "_offset": 3576,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 10,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Let's go... I don't want to make\nany more Digimon into victims.",
      "_offset": 3643,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 114,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3707,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I agree!",
      "_offset": 3713,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Thank you so much! Our Koromon\nwill get better...",
      "_offset": 3722,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "We want you to receive this in\ngratitude!",
      "_offset": 3772,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 103,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Thank you! We'll take it. We'll\ndefeat the Dark Masters, for sure!",
      "_offset": 3814,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 87,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Leave it to us!",
      "_offset": 3881,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 114,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I have to do my brother's share\ntoo, so I'll do my best!",
      "_offset": 3897,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "You're getting really dependable,\nTakeru.",
      "_offset": 3954,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "U-ugh...",
      "_offset": 3996,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "It's having a nightmare... its\neyes are full of fear...",
      "_offset": 4005,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "We could make it easier for him if\nwe had the herb...",
      "_offset": 4061,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "The herb should be a red flower\nthat's bigger than us. It should\nbe nearby.",
      "_offset": 4115,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 116,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "It's hard to find, so keep that in\nmind.",
      "_offset": 4191,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 114,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Got it. We'll keep an eye out.",
      "_offset": 4232,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Are you gonna fight the Dark\nMasters? They're a lot scarier\nthan Etemon.",
      "_offset": 4263,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 101,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Yeah, we'll fight whoever we have\nto fight.",
      "_offset": 4336,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 105,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "If we had more of the herb, we'd\nshare it with you...",
      "_offset": 4387,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 115,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "We're fine. Don't worry about us.",
      "_offset": 4441,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 46,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "I can't poop properly like this...",
      "_offset": 4475,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 114,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Why do you think Yamato left?",
      "_offset": 4510,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 105,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "(I have no idea...)",
      "_offset": 4540,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 44,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "(I have an idea.)",
      "_offset": 4560,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 117,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "I *never* have any idea what he's\nthinking!",
      "_offset": 4578,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 114,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Don't say things like that,\nTaichi.",
      "_offset": 4622,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 101,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "He's a pretty blunt guy.",
      "_offset": 4662,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "He probably didn't know what to do\nfor himself, rather than what to\ndo for Takeru.",
      "_offset": 4687,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 108,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "I guess Yamato really does keep\neveryone in mind...",
      "_offset": 4770,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 10,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "That's why I'm sure he'll come\nback!",
      "_offset": 4822,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 116,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "We've gotten separated...",
      "_offset": 4859,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "I'm counting on you, Koushirou.",
      "_offset": 4885,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 104,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "We're separated, but still friends.",
      "_offset": 4917,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 99,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "I'm grateful for your confidence\nin me, but it's a little too much\nfor me to handle...",
      "_offset": 4953,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 119,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "That's true... we've fought\ntogether as comrades up until now.",
      "_offset": 5044,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi. Can I stay with the\nKoromon?",
      "_offset": 5107,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "You have a mission, right Hikari?",
      "_offset": 5149,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "We can't leave you behind.",
      "_offset": 5183,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 46,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "We have to defeat the Dark\nMasters.",
      "_offset": 5210,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Yeah, I know...",
      "_offset": 5246,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 111,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "That's not what you said\nearlier...",
      "_offset": 5262,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 108,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "I just wanted to know if you'd try\nto take me with you.",
      "_offset": 5298,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 68,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "We can't leave you behind, you\nknow.",
      "_offset": 5354,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 116,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 5391,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 105,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "What if you get targeted after we\nleave...?",
      "_offset": 5397,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 110,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "But aren't you worried about the\nKoromon?",
      "_offset": 5441,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 32,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "You have to understand, Hikari...",
      "_offset": 5483,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 99,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "We're gonna need more herbs than\nthat if we want to cure those\nwounds.",
      "_offset": 5521,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 116,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}